{"id":"691db50ca30cc6ef0742c8264ecada58f19964be","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/wctgzdX4CN2RVxCm.html","title":"Google 杀入 Jev 核心赛道：Gemini Decision 1 五项基准领先两项落后","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"Jev 拿下的 75 亿美元估值曾被质疑是一场泡沫。现在 Google 用一款多模态决策模型告诉市场：这不是泡沫，是赛道。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"Google 杀入 Jev 核心赛道：Gemini Decision 1 五项基准领先两项落后\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafPgfzTnickARyPogGiatIpGoE4RjKhg3fanNYeT37XIyU54xpxPUMD5Yn1gtoPKCPkFebCJdianyvJiatibGLdNqwt0eklqZkk1TxPg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"300\" data-imgfileid=\"100265320\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261119/6afebc66439ac.jpg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261119/6afebc66439ac.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\">Jev 拿下的 75 亿美元估值曾被质疑是一场泡沫。现在 Google 用一款多模态决策模型告诉市场：这不是泡沫，是赛道。</span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mwdbbkuexb9\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><s